      "text": "```python\nimport pandas as pd\nimport json\n\ntotals = {}\n\nchunksize = 200_000\nusecols = [\"account_id\", \"category\", \"amount_cents\"]\ndtypes = {\n    \"account_id\": \"int64\",\n    \"category\": \"category\",\n    \"amount_cents\": \"int64\",\n}\n\nfor chunk in pd.read_csv(\n    \"transactions_secondary.csv\",\n    usecols=usecols,\n    dtype=dtypes,\n    chunksize=chunksize,\n):\n    mod13 = chunk[\"account_id\"] % 13\n    mask = mod13 < 8\n    if not mask.any():\n        continue\n\n    sub = chunk.loc[mask]\n    mult = (sub[\"account_id\"] % 89) + 3\n    weighted = sub[\"amount_cents\"].astype(\"int64\") * mult.astype(\"int64\")\n\n    grouped = weighted.groupby(sub[\"category\"], observed=True).sum()\n\n    for cat, val in grouped.items():\n        cat = str(cat)\n        totals[cat] = totals.get(cat, 0) + int(val)\n\nresult = {k: totals[k] for k in sorted(totals.keys())}\n\nprint(\"TOTAL:\" + json.dumps(result))\n```",
